From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Sun, 7 Jun 2026 15:55:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 00834/11171] [outer-loop] #4 v3: energy-as-teacher SUGGESTIVE
 positive (within noise), headroom law

Under-trained base (4.5%, headroom): energy-RFT (no labels) +1.0%, MATCHING gold-SFT
+0.8% (frac gold ceiling ~1.25). First positive direction for verifier-as-self-
improvement-reward. But within noise (~1 SE at n=512, 1 seed) -- suggestive not
decisive. Cross-version headroom law: v2 saturated->nobody lifts; v3 headroom->both
lift comparably. Energy teaches ~as well as gold WHERE headroom exists, like P0.1.
Robust generative positive across all runs = the in-loop gate (#3, +1.8-2.5%).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
